{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/6efc2c775821cc377a7680dbb6d659fd.avif?t=1772736042\" width=320 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Drop: Save the Forest</strong>, you step into the tiny yet determined droplets of <i>Drop</i>, a water hero sent by the Rain Clouds to protect a burning alpine forest.<br>Inspired by the stunning landscapes of the <strong>Dolomites</strong>, the game blends <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, exploration, and environmental storytelling into a charming pixel art adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/02362c63080f17eb3d0c64913c2735f1.poster.avif?t=1772736042\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/02362c63080f17eb3d0c64913c2735f1.webm?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/02362c63080f17eb3d0c64913c2735f1.mp4?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wildfire is ravaging the forest. Plants, animals, and entire biomes are in danger.<br>Armed with your water abilities, you\u2019ll navigate from the mountain\u2019s base to its snowy peaks, solving environmental puzzles, extinguishing fires, and restoring balance to nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/e78b49d2d3a01409a1d4a7ba6409d931.poster.avif?t=1772736042\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/e78b49d2d3a01409a1d4a7ba6409d931.webm?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/e78b49d2d3a01409a1d4a7ba6409d931.mp4?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-based Levels</strong> \u2013 Each stage challenges you to think creatively, combining elements like <strong>water, ice, wind, and fire</strong> to restore harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong> \u2013 Push rocks, unlock water sources, climb cliffs, and use the terrain to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> \u2013 Beware! Wind can spread pollen\u2026 or fire. Fire can block your path\u2026 or become your main obstacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlife Encounters</strong> \u2013 Meet friendly forest creatures to rescue and dangerous elemental \u201cfire\u201d enemies to outsmart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/9672cd491ecaf0c379299a93590efa1a.poster.avif?t=1772736042\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/9672cd491ecaf0c379299a93590efa1a.webm?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/9672cd491ecaf0c379299a93590efa1a.mp4?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Nature-inspired settings</strong> based on alpine environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging environmental puzzles</strong> with multiple solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 <strong>Unique elemental mechanics</strong> that interact in surprising ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming pixel art</strong> and hand-crafted animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/dac9744ce8b3cb93dfe40cac6bec02b9.poster.avif?t=1772736042\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/dac9744ce8b3cb93dfe40cac6bec02b9.webm?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932710/extras/dac9744ce8b3cb93dfe40cac6bec02b9.mp4?t=1772736042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the elements and save the forest?</strong><br>The forest needs its hero\u2026 will you be <i>the Drop</i> that makes the difference? \ud83d\udca6\u2728</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wildfire appeared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932710/3142907c384b932aa51dd2bbb7b96414b8ec6f90.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Elements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932710/92a596e83351e6a44912c871dadcf8033b2bdcbf.jpg"},{"name":"All Four 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932710/96d3c7c6dabd5741de86e9b65f3f1fbc7377faf9.jpg"},{"name":"You are alone now!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st